  "title": "NaturAll Wants You To Make Your Voice Heard",
  "summary": "As the presidential election date November 3, 2020 gets closer and closer, NaturAll believes it is important to do our part to ensure that you have the resources you need to have your voice heard and your political opinions accounted for in our government. As a Black woman-owned business based in the predominantly Black city of Philadelphia, this upcoming election is incredibly important for everyone involved. Read on to find out more!",
